{
  "job_B2.2.8_20261117_181940": {
    "chunk_text": "HER ONGYN\u00f0 Leofan men, eallum cristenum mannum is mycel \u00feearf \u00fe\u00e6t hy heora cristendomes gescad witan, & \u00fe\u00e6t Be Cristes agenum naman syn cristene genamode, for\u00f0am Crist is cristenra heafod, & ealle cristene men Lytel frema\u00f0 \u00feeah cristen nama butan cristenum d\u00e6dum, ac se bi\u00f0 rihtlice cristen \u00fee Cristes larum & his Se \u00fee secge \u00fe\u00e6t he on Crist gelyfe, fare se \u00fe\u00e6s rihtweges \u00fee Crist sylf ferde. And \u00f0eah hwa cwe\u00f0e \u00fe\u00e6t he on Crist rihtlice gelyfe & nele his larum ne his lagum folgian, he lih\u00f0 him Gyf ge me lufian, he cw\u00e6\u00f0, folgia\u00f0 minum larum, for\u00f0am se me ne lufia\u00f0 na \u00fee nele minum larum Nu age we \u00feearfe \u00fee cristene syndon \u00fe\u00e6t we georne his larum & his lagum fyligean. Leofan men, hit gewear\u00f0 on geardagum \u00fe\u00e6t God sylf sp\u00e6c hludre stefne of Synai Munte to Moyse \u00feam Ic eom \u00f0in Drihten, he cw\u00e6\u00f0, \u00fee gel\u00e6dde \u00fee ut of Egyptum. Ne weor\u00f0a \u00feu fremde godas. Ne \u00feu \u00feines Drihtnes naman ne namie on idel. Wite \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0u \u00fe\u00e6ne rested\u00e6g freolsige georne. Weor\u00f0a geornlice f\u00e6der & modor. Ne beo \u00f0u \u00e6nig manslaga. Ne afyl \u00fee mid forligere. Ne scea\u00fea \u00f0u. Ne leoh \u00feu. Ne gyrn \u00f0u o\u00f0res mannes wifes, ne \u00e6niges \u00feinges \u00fee o\u00f0er man age ne gyrn \u00feu on unriht. \u00d0as tyn beboda God sylf gedihte & awrat & Moyse bef\u00e6",
